      "name": "Table service",
      "steps": [
        {
          "stepId": "table-set",
          "name": "Set out plates, pickles and sauce",
          "task": "prep",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": "10m" },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "toast-buns" }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "call-everyone",
          "name": "Call everyone over and lay it all out",
          "task": "prep",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": "5m" },
          "startTrigger": {
            "type": "compound",
            "logic": "all",
            "triggers": [
              { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "pull-pork" },
              { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "table-set" },
              { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "dress-refrigerate" }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "resourceConstraints": [
    { "task": "smoker", "maxConcurrent": 1 },
    { "task": "prep", "maxConcurrent": 2 },
    { "task": "side_burner", "maxConcurrent": 1 },
    { "task": "cooler", "maxConcurrent": 1 },
    { "task": "fridge", "maxConcurrent": 1 },
    { "task": "kettle", "maxConcurrent": 1 }
  ],
  "metadata": {
    "ingredients": [
      { "name": "pork shoulder", "measure": "8-10 lb" },
      { "name": "salt, pepper, paprika rub", "measure": "to taste" },
      { "name": "butcher paper", "measure": "1 roll" },
      { "name": "bacon", "measure": "1/2 lb, diced" },
      { "name": "onion", "measure": "1, diced" },
      { "name": "canned baked beans", "measure": "2 large cans" },
      { "name": "molasses", "measure": "1/4 cup" },
      { "name": "cabbage", "measure": "1 head, shredded" },
      { "name": "carrot", "measure": "2, shredded" },
      { "name": "buttermilk dressing", "measure": "1 batch" },
      { "name": "sausages", "measure": "12 links" },
      { "name": "corn on the cob", "measure": "12 ears" },
      { "name": "buns", "measure": "12" },
      { "name": "pickles and sauce", "measure": "for serving" }
    ],
    "serves": "12",
    "sourceUrl": "",
    "attribution": ""
  }
}
```

Notes on how this was built (tools unavailable in this session, so verified by hand):

- **Critical path**: light-smoker(45m)/trim-rub(25m) → smoke-unwrapped(6h) → wrap-paper(10m) → smoke-wrapped(default 3h30m) → cooler-hold(default 2h) → pull-pork(30m), landing pull-pork's end at ≈ t+12h55m.
- **Beans/slaw** both start exactly when `cooler-hold` *starts* (pork "goes into the cooler"), via `afterStep ... event:"start"`.
- **Grill** is delayed with `programStartOffset: 43380s` (723 min) so `toast-buns` finishes right as `pull-pork` does — i.e. the kettle is lit about an hour before the meal, matching the source.
- **Table**: `table-set` follows `toast-buns`; `call-everyone` is a compound "all" barrier on `pull-pork`, `table-set`, and `dress-refrigerate` (slaw), matching "when both cooks say it is ready."
- Every `task` (smoker, prep, side_burner, cooler, fridge, kettle) has a matching `resourceConstraint`; `prep` is capped at 2 to reflect the two cooks, everything else at 1 (one smoker, one kettle, one burner, one cooler, one fridge slot for the slaw).
- No repeated-instance work (no trays/samples) is present, so no `replicates` were needed.

Since the live MCP tools (`validate_program`, `analyze_schedule`, `visualize_schedule`) are unavailable in this offline session, no live URL/Gantt could be generated — the program JSON above is the complete, ready-to-submit deliverable for those tools when available.

